[Desktop Entry]
Categories=Graphics;
Comment=SunnyCapturer is a simple and beautiful cross-platform screenshot software tool that supports OCR to extract text from images, image translation, and pinning images to the screen, among other features
Comment[zh_CN]=SunnyCapturer 是一款简单且漂亮的跨平台截图软件工具，支持 OCR 从图片中提取文本，图片翻译，以及将图片钉在屏幕上等功能
Comment[pt_BR]=SunnyCapturer é uma ferramenta simples e elegante para captura de tela multiplataforma. Ela oferece suporte para OCR para extrair texto de imagens, tradução de imagens e a opção de fixar imagens na tela, entre outras funcionalidades
Exec=SunnyCapturer
GenericName=Sunny Capturer
GenericName[zh_CN]=Sunny Capturer
GenericName[pt_BR]=Sunny Capturer
Icon=sunnycapturer
Keywords=SunnyCapturer;Sunny;Capturer;ScreenShot;Image;Snapshot;XMuli;偕臧;
MimeType=image/bmp;image/bmp24;image/jpg;image/jpe;image/jpeg;image/jpeg24;image/jng;image/pcd;image/pcx;image/png;image/tif;image/tiff;image/tiff24;image/dds;image/gif;image/sgi;image/j2k;image/jp2;image/pct;image/wdp;image/arw;image/icb;image/dng;image/vda;image/vst;image/svg;image/ptif;image/mef;image/xbm;image/svg+xml;
Name=SunnyCapturer
Name[zh_CN]=SunnyCapturer
Name[pt_BR]=SunnyCapturer
StartupNotify=false
Type=Application
Terminal=false
X-GNOME-Autostart-enabled=true


